Lakṣmaṇa denounces doting love-swayed king --- Lakṣmaṇa vows to empty hostile Ayōdhyā --- Lakṣmaṇa swears to precede Rāma into fire --- Kausalyā forbids forest journey and bids obedience --- Kausalyā cites Kāśyapa obeying mother to reach heaven --- Kausalyā threatens fasting death without Rāma --- Rāma pleads inability to transgress father --- Rāma cites Kaṇḍu Sagara Paraśurāma precedents --- Rāma bids Lakṣmaṇa abandon kṣatra fierceness --- Rāma begs blessing and promises return